衍生自 AOSP 的部分 / Portions derived from AOSP
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

1. rkp_csr.py

   本文件是 AOSP `system/security/provisioner/rkp_factory_extraction_tool.cpp`
   中 `composeCertificateRequest()`（android13-release，第 96-115 行）的
   Python 翻译与实现。

   This file is a Python translation and implementation of
   `composeCertificateRequest()` in AOSP
   `system/security/provisioner/rkp_factory_extraction_tool.cpp`
   (android13-release, lines 96-115).

2. CSR / COSE / CBOR 结构定义 / structure definitions

   证书请求、COSE_Mac0、COSE_Sign1、DeviceInfo、ProtectedData、MacedPublicKey
   等结构定义参考 AOSP `hardware/interfaces` 中的
   `IRemotelyProvisionedComponent.aidl` 与相关 CDDL。

   The structures for certificate requests, COSE_Mac0, COSE_Sign1, DeviceInfo,
   ProtectedData and MacedPublicKey follow `IRemotelyProvisionedComponent.aidl`
   and the related CDDL in AOSP `hardware/interfaces`.

